{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：11:14 2026-10-24 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"私家車剷上行人路撞巴士站候車乘客。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/a9034bdbedf08c9e75fc42cb6020ef13/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_26_1__0.jpeg\"/>\n<p>八鄉粉錦公路發生交通意外。一輛往上水方向行駛的公共小巴在路旁停車落客，正準備重新起步之際，突遭一輛尾隨的私家車從後猛烈撞擊，私家車更剷上行人路，導致在巴士站候車3名市民無辜受傷，包括一男一女及一名6歲女童，幸僅輕傷俱送院救治。警方正調查意外原因。</p>\n<img alt=\"小巴司機鄭先生幸無恙。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/71ca67854ddd2ab2361a3e4b84a38659/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_22.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/537e00510427101699c7fa6b871ce82a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_22_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2a4be5e236f58b1e96f15821fa3d6103/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_23.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"私家車稍後被拖走檢驗。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bc490d9ee9fbb6a9697093d39007c5d3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_23_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d3749ea0ab5268fb5c579d2b5e097448/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_24.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/935b3376c499d8dc360b23f17a392863/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_24_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<h3>小巴落客後準備起步 驚聞「砰」然巨響</h3>\n<p>涉事小巴司機鄭先生在意外後接受訪問，講述事發一刻。他表示，當時他正將小巴停泊在路旁讓乘客下車，當乘客落車完畢，他正準備重新開車起步。車尾突然傳來一聲「砰」的猛烈撞擊巨響，赫然發現小巴左車身與一輛私家車相撞。鄭先生指，涉事的私家車在事發前一直跟在其小巴的後方，當時車速並不快，他直言「我都唔知佢點樣撞上嚟」。</p>\n<img alt=\"私家車擋風玻璃爆裂。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/822199d40642cec38f769f8a58b5779f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_24_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fc954909ae8d888a51878e5c95093b47/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_25_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/046917a9e202b22718ee2bb71785fdb4/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_26.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4e51da61045acb8be77902419644d287/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_26_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"私家車剷上行人路撞巴士站候車途人。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/37c71abfc1e6515cf04ba3ab46e8fcfc/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_28.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cda32ac46b492113f1a9f3ec0cb23cb3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_29.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/375efb1ff1322c387c0622e4403e580f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_26_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dc3487fa21a4b5db50f86b02822fd09f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_25.jpeg\"/>\n<h3>私家車載有一對男女 候車市民無辜受傷</h3>\n<p>涉事私家車擋風玻璃爆裂，男司機及女乘客均無受傷，事後在場協查。鄭先生透露，其小巴當時只載有數名準備前往上水的乘客，車上無人受傷，私家車剷上行人路，撞到正在打石湖巴士站候車的途人，包括一名老翁、一名女子及一名6歲女童。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T03:24:13.018290+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":450,"images":15,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T03:14:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T07:18:30.834978+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T03:18:23.777176+00:00","content_hash":"8ff8bbfd4c1259ea17db150abeb36de89619cd94d58a67c8cfe64b0af5db452c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}